sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Intake UI
  participant Edge as queue_join Edge Function
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant SMS as Twilio

  Customer->>UI: Choose service; enter contact; accept consent
  UI->>UI: Validate required fields and E.164-capable phone
  UI->>Edge: POST airport, location, contact, consent, offeringCode
  Edge->>Edge: Validate, normalize phone, enforce rate limits
  rect rgb(232, 244, 255)
    Note over Edge,DB: One database RPC transaction
    Edge->>DB: join_queue_with_offering(...)
    DB->>DB: Resolve open offering, consent, location, queue
    DB->>DB: Lock queue row + queue/class allocation; upsert customer
    DB->>DB: Reuse or insert active queue entry
    DB->>DB: Insert joined event + confirmation outbox row
    DB-->>Edge: entry, capability token, status, initial position
  end
  Note over Edge,DB: RPC has returned; durable work is committed
  Edge->>SMS: Best-effort immediate confirmation send
  alt send/persist fails
    Edge->>Edge: Log incomplete delivery; durable row remains retryable
  end
  Edge-->>UI: 200 with entry and initial position
  UI-->>Customer: Show joined state and SMS expectation
